    "trap_category": "Intermediate result",
    "setup": "A stock has bid \\$331 and ask \\$335. The sample sd of the proportional spread is $0.00019$. Expected per-share cost $= P \\cdot s/2 = \\$2.00$. The 95% upper bound adds $P \\cdot \\tfrac12 \\cdot z\\sigma_s$ with $z = 1.65$ and $P$ the midprice.",
